# Uploaded media written by the `local` storage adapter.
# Development artefact: never source-controlled, and deliberately outside
# apps/web/public so uploads can never become part of a build.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash. An unanchored `storage/` matches a directory
# of that name at ANY depth, which silently excluded the storage *source
# module* at src/shared/storage/ — caught by noticing it missing from
# `git status`.
/storage/
